  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(0.625 ÷ 2.5) × (5/8 × 2)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nDivision and multiplication rules\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 0.625 = 5/8\n\n⇒ 2.5 = 5/2\n\n⇒ (5/8 ÷ 5/2) × (5/8 × 2)\n\n⇒ (5/8 × 2/5) × (5/8 × 2)\n\n⇒ (1/4) × (10/8)\n\n⇒ = 1/4 × 5/4\n\n⇒ = 5/16 = 0.3125\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 0.3125****.**",
